sing read-only tools now, focusing on the user's ultimate goal to make 2 videos a day, without burnout. My first step is ensuring these agents challenge the original assessment, but also remain realistic. I've designed the agents to report back with verifiable claims. I've just now launched the team and will await their initial findings.\n\n\n**Analyzing Production Efficiency**\n\nI'm now directing my focus to optimizing video production time. My research agents are looking at how to reduce the 5.5-7.8 hour production time for GTA 5 Spider-Man videos. Specifically, I'm now looking into workflows, tutorials, and potential shortcuts within the Rockstar Editor to streamline content creation. I'm keen to see how content farms handle this scale of production. I'm also asking my agents to verify ways to produce two 20-minute videos a day.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"invoke_subagent","args":{"Subagents":"[{\"Model\":\"inherit\",\"Prompt\":\"Challenge the claim that GTA 5 Spider-Man kids videos take 5.5-7.8 hours to make. Search the web and YouTube for workflows, tutorials, Rockstar Editor shortcuts, or macros that allow creators to pump out these 20-min videos easily and fast. How are content farms doing it at scale? What is the absolute fastest way to make them?\",\"Role\":\"Production Optimizer\",\"TypeName\":\"research\"},{\"Model\":\"inherit\",\"Prompt\":\"Investigate the 'Reused Content' monetization loophole for GTA 5 mod videos. If Nemo (@nemo-gta) failed and MARINARA (@GTAPRINCE-o7n) succeeded, what is the exact minimum effort required to pass the monetization check? Is there an easy way to guarantee monetization without recording human voiceovers? Search for advice from creators who got monetized in this exact niche.\",\"Role\":\"Monetization Hacker\",\"TypeName\":\"research\"},{\"Model\":\"inherit\",\"Prompt\":\"Investigate the real-world COPPA and Disney copyright strike risks for GTA 5 superhero videos. Are these channels actually getting sued/fined, or is the risk just theoretical? Give concrete evidence of crackdowns on GTA 5 kids channels, or evidence that YouTube/Disney ignores them.\",\"Role\":\"Risk Realist\",\"TypeName\":\"research\"},{\"Model\":\"inherit\",\"Prompt\":\"Challenge the claim that an $1800+ PC is required for GTA 5 heavy modding (Spooner maps, AddonPeds, multiple ragdolls). Can this be done on a budget setup? What about using Cloud PCs (like Shadow PC) for GTA modding? Find the cheapest barrier to entry.\",\"Role\":\"Hardware Analyst\",\"TypeName\":\"research\"},{\"Model\":\"inherit\",\"Prompt\":\"Research how to mass-produce GTA 5 kids videos easily. What is the standard operating procedure (SOP) used by overseas content farms to make 2+ videos a day in this niche? Identify the exact tools, mods, and steps for a beginner to make lots of videos fast.\",\"Role\":\"Scale Strategist\",\"TypeName\":\"research\"}]","toolAction":"\"Launching 5 research agents\"","toolSummary":"\"Spawn Gemini Strike Team\""}}]}
